{
  "v": 1,
  "about": "Protocol 6.4 as data. Each scenario: the page, the refsure command steps (each run as `<env> node <refsure dist>/refsure.mjs <argv> --page <P>`), and per cfg the expected cell: per-step envelope matchers (pass, safe, fail; 'skipped' = the step must not run) and the expected click-log lines. A cfg whose cell is a string takes that cfg's cell. E22-E33 come from the frozen N12 set by id. Step `run`: 'always'; {ticket: n} = step n returned a ticket; {ok: [n]} = step n ended ok; {exit: [n, [codes]]}. `{Tn}` = step n's result.ticket; `{NAME}` = a ref taken from a snap step (`refs`). Matcher keys: status, exit, acted, cause (envelope why.cause; a list = any member), decision (null = no Decision), next (next.do), next_argv (next.argv joined by spaces), clicked (a dismissed level's control by name), after/before (an event line logged before/after the command exited); any other key is read from `result`. A value {ne: x} = present and not x; {includes: s} = a string containing s; 'non-null' = present.",
  "seed": "refsure-bench-20261016",
  "cfgs": ["cli_both", "cli_jev", "cli_jevor", "cli_oa"],
  "backends": ["orca", "agent-browser"],
  "repeats": 3,
  "n12Set": "tools/bench/sets/n12.jsonl",
  "siteMeta": "tools/bench/fixtures/meta/site2.json",
  "scenarios": [
    { "id": "E01", "entry": "/site2/search.html", "steps": [{ "n": 1, "argv": "dismiss", "run": "always" }],
      "expect": {
        "cli_both": { "cell": "pass", "steps": { "1": { "pass": [{ "status": "ok", "exit": 0, "acted": true, "clicked": "Reject all" }] } }, "lines": [{ "name": "Reject all", "count": 1 }] },
        "cli_jev": "cli_both", "cli_jevor": "cli_both",
        "cli_oa": { "cell": "pass", "steps": { "1": { "pass": [{ "status": "refused", "exit": 11, "acted": false, "cause": "provider_not_allowed" }] } }, "lines": [] } } },
    { "id": "E02", "entry": "/site2/cookie-injected.html", "steps": [{ "n": 1, "argv": "dismiss", "run": "always" }],
